WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.900
Welcome aboard.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.900
I’m glad you’re here.

3
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:13.425
Over the next fifteen lessons, we’re going to work through the Navigation Rules together, the part of the captain’s exam that trips up more people than any other.

4
00:00:13.675 --> 00:00:15.225
Here’s why.

5
00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:18.875
Every other module needs seventy percent to pass.

6
00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:21.075
This one needs ninety.

7
00:00:21.325 --> 00:00:25.025
Out of fifty questions, you can miss only about five.

8
00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:36.300
So we’ll cover every rule, from Rule one through Rule thirty-eight, plus the annexes the exam pulls from, and after each lesson there’s a short check so you can make sure it stuck.

9
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.500
Don’t worry about memorizing everything today.

10
00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.800
Just get comfortable with how the rules are built.

11
00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:48.225
The memorizing comes later, and I’ll give you plenty of tricks for it.
